cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this specification, please cite it."
title: "PP-SPEC-064: Proof of Efficacy Mapping to IETF SCITT"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ellrod"
    given-names: "Craig"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license-url: "https://github.com/proofprotocol/PP-SPEC-064-ietf-scitt-mapping/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
repository-code: "https://github.com/proofprotocol/PP-SPEC-064-ietf-scitt-mapping"
abstract: "A Proof Protocol mapping specification defining how proof records, ProofBundle, ProofStamp, and ProofRegister artifacts can be expressed as IETF SCITT Signed Statements, registered with a Transparency Service, and carried as Transparent Statements with COSE Receipts (RFC 9943, RFC 9942), without changing what constitutes proof."
keywords:
  - "Proof Protocol"
  - "Proof of Efficacy"
  - "IETF SCITT"
  - "RFC 9943"
  - "RFC 9942"
  - "COSE Receipts"
  - "transparency service"
  - "supply chain integrity"
  - "interoperability"
  - "evidence"
  - "efficacy"
  - "proof"
